OL,3,GNEWSA'Get in' - woman joins police
OL,4,Achase by giving officer a lift in
OL,5,ANissan Micra
OL,6,
OL,7,FA female driver came to the aid of a
OL,8,Fpolice officer who was chasing a
OL,9,Fsuspect on foot - telling him to "get
OL,10,Fin" after stopping her Nissan Micra and
OL,11,Foffering him a lift.
OL,13,FThe officer had been pursuing Jacob
OL,14,FRoberts, 25, who had reverse-rammed a
OL,15,Fpolice car twice and crashed into
OL,16,Fparked cars and a building while trying
OL,17,Fto escape.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
