OL,3,GNEWSA'Get in' - woman joins police
OL,4,Achase by giving officer a lift in
OL,5,ANissan Micra
OL,6,
OL,7,FRoberts sped away from officers who had
OL,8,Fsmelled cannabis coming from his van,
OL,9,Fwith the chase seeing him drive in an
OL,10,Ferratic manner, failing to stop at
OL,11,Fmultiple junctions, mounting pavements
OL,12,Fand putting pedestrians at risk.
OL,14,FThe driver helped PC Kerswell catch up
OL,15,Fto Roberts, who was arrested and later
OL,16,Fjailed for one year and two months for
OL,17,Fa number of driving offences.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
